1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,255
You ask your AI to choose a time tracker.

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:08,666
The page says free trial. The answer says free forever.

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,239
A confident sentence. Two unsupported leaps.

4
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,578
Put JERP between the source and the answer.

5
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:23,483
It screens incoming content, then
checks the claims against sources.

6
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:30,102
A trial is supported. Free
forever is contradicted. Best is opinion.

7
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:36,611
Compact facts, with sources, inside your size
limit. Less for your AI to read.

8
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:41,481
Your AI can answer from those facts. You can check the source.

9
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:47,991
No source, no claim. JERP. Confidence
in the Truth. Stop guessing. Start checking.
